  <Properties>
    <lead>
      <Value><![CDATA[Bước 1 là việc quan trọng nhất: đừng chuyển thêm bất cứ khoản nào.]]></Value>
    </lead>
    <slug>
      <Value><![CDATA[tien-da-dua-di-nhung-khong-lay-lai-duoc]]></Value>
    </slug>
    <sourceCode>
      <Value><![CDATA[p5]]></Value>
    </sourceCode>
    <steps>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "fac60482-5341-5cbd-a054-455730e1a096",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Kh\u00F4ng chuy\u1EC3n th\u00EAm ti\u1EC1n cho b\u00EAn \u0111ang gi\u1EEF ti\u1EC1n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, ho\u1EB7c v\u00E0o t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n h\u1ECD ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh, \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c r\u00FAt ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\u1EADn l\u1EA1i ti\u1EC1n."
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "H\u1ECD c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi kho\u1EA3n \u0111\u00F3 l\u00E0 \u201Cg\u1EE1 l\u1ED7\u201D, \u201Cti\u1EC1n thu\u1EBF\u201D, \u201Cph\u00ED x\u00E1c minh\u201D, \u201Cph\u00ED m\u1EDF kh\u00F3a r\u00FAt ti\u1EC1n\u201D.\nN\u1EBFu h\u1ECD n\u00F3i \u0111\u00F3 l\u00E0 kho\u1EA3n b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c theo quy \u0111\u1ECBnh, h\u00E3y t\u1EF1 ki\u1EC3m tra v\u1EDBi c\u01A1 quan nh\u00E0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc ph\u1EE5 tr\u00E1ch tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi chuy\u1EC3n b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 \u0111\u1ED3ng n\u00E0o."
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "34b6f6cd-721a-5c9d-a815-1adb9cd58ad6",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Ghi ra ba vi\u1EC7c, c\u00E0ng c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 c\u00E0ng t\u1ED1t: b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1EE9a nh\u1EEFng g\u00EC; h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng ho\u1EB7c th\u1ECFa thu\u1EADn n\u00F3i g\u00EC; v\u00E0 l\u00FD do h\u1ECD \u0111\u01B0a ra \u0111\u1EC3 kh\u00F4ng tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n cho b\u1EA1n."
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "B\u1EA1n kh\u00F4ng c\u1EA7n t\u1EF1 k\u1EBFt lu\u1EADn \u0111\u00E2y l\u00E0 l\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EA3o hay l\u00E0 r\u1EE7i ro kinh doanh. Vi\u1EC7c \u0111\u00F3 kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "b6b6bc34-d484-5c3c-a0da-0d92b5a4fb97",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "T\u00ECm l\u1EA1i h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng, sao k\u00EA, tin nh\u1EAFn v\u00E0 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n r\u00FAt v\u1ED1n b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 k\u00FD ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u1ED3ng \u00FD."
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "79893d7b-526b-5780-add4-ed9d8b10caf7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Li\u00EAn h\u1EC7 \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB \u0111\u00E3 nh\u1EADn, gi\u1EEF ho\u1EB7c chuy\u1EC3n ti\u1EC1n trong giao d\u1ECBch, v\u00E0 c\u01A1 quan nh\u00E0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EA5p ph\u00E9p cho lo\u1EA1i d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 \u0111\u00F3."
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "2d1b040d-e931-5827-a9af-e45689f5bd38",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n nghi m\u00ECnh b\u1ECB \u0111\u01B0a th\u00F4ng tin gi\u1EA3, gi\u1EA5y t\u1EDD gi\u1EA3, ho\u1EB7c ti\u1EC1n b\u1ECB c\u1ED1 \u00FD gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i \u2014 \u0111\u1EBFn C\u00F4ng an n\u01A1i g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t ho\u1EB7c n\u01A1i b\u1EA1n c\u01B0 tr\u00FA \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u00ECnh b\u00E1o nh\u1EEFng g\u00EC b\u1EA1n \u0111ang c\u00F3."
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Kh\u00F4ng ch\u1EDD t\u1EDBi khi t\u1EF1 th\u1EA5y \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u1EE7 ch\u1EE9ng c\u1EE9. Vi\u1EC7c x\u00E1c \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u00FAng sai l\u00E0 c\u1EE7a c\u01A1 quan c\u00F3 th\u1EA9m quy\u1EC1n."
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "74db6466-684a-52eb-a868-49b99b12df16",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Kh\u00F4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1ECDi kho\u1EA3n l\u1ED7 hay kho\u1EA3n ph\u1EA3i tr\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u l\u00E0 l\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EA3o. Vay, b\u1EA3o hi\u1EC3m, \u0111\u1EA7u t\u01B0 h\u1EE3p ph\u00E1p \u0111\u1EC1u c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 ph\u00E1t sinh kho\u1EA3n b\u1EA1n kh\u00F4ng l\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc. Vi\u1EC7c c\u1EA7n l\u00E0m kh\u00E1c \u0111i: \u0111\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i \u0111\u00FAng b\u1EA3n h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1EA1n \u0111\u00E3 k\u00FD, ghi ra t\u1EEBng kho\u1EA3n ch\u01B0a hi\u1EC3u, \u0111\u1EC1 ngh\u1ECB \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB gi\u1EA3i th\u00EDch b\u1EB1ng v\u0103n b\u1EA3n, v\u00E0 h\u1ECFi c\u01A1 quan nh\u00E0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EA5p ph\u00E9p cho lo\u1EA1i d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 \u0111\u00F3 n\u1EBFu v\u1EABn ch\u01B0a r\u00F5. Website kh\u00F4ng thay \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u00FD ki\u1EBFn c\u1EE7a lu\u1EADt s\u01B0 v\u00E0 kh\u00F4ng k\u1EBFt lu\u1EADn \u0111\u00FAng sai cho tr\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EE3p c\u1EE5 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "N\u1EBFu \u0111\u00E2y l\u00E0 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1EE3p ph\u00E1p m\u00E0 b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a hi\u1EC3u h\u1EBFt"
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "ee230f5e-3bd0-5c0b-aebf-28c344b66508",
      "key": "83a42f0a-4641-5b04-af60-319305f6c03f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "summary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "details",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "N\u1EBFu h\u1ECD y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u tr\u1EA3 ti\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, h\u00E3y d\u1EEBng li\u00EAn h\u1EC7 ngay. Mu\u1ED1n thu\u00EA d\u1ECBch v\u1EE5 th\u1EADt th\u00EC b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 \u0111i t\u00ECm, \u0111\u1EEBng d\u00F9ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EF1 nh\u1EAFn tin \u0111\u1EBFn."
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "noticeTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\u0110\u1EEBng tr\u1EA3 ph\u00ED cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1EE9a l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i ti\u1EC1n"
        },
        {
          "alias": "links",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
